{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NOTE: This is the old version of Pacifish. The new rebuilt version is Pacifish: Recast. This and its associated DLC will remain free, but will not be updated. Thank you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pacifish is an incremental fishing management game with several mechanics to interact with and improve. It can be played both idly, or more actively to progress faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fish - Acquire and equip poles and tackle to fish in 6 unlockable areas.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight - Disturbing the waters causes both the fish and the materials to fight back. Earn pixels to improve fighting stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hatch - Set up and upgrade incubators to hatch large quantities of fish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat - Consume those large quantities to improve stats such as fishing speed and fight stats.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swim - Manually take control of a fish to eat other fish and gain resources.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gamble - Spend your earned coin to play slots, or test your memory in a match game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft - Use materials to craft new poles and tackle, as well as create mods to alter pole stats.</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Fisher","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1996930/2fd7a897d11ee0a9b38be9f3dc01da2740e64232.jpg"},{"name":"Goldfish","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1996930/2fd7a897d11ee0a9b38be9f3dc01da2740e64232.jpg"},{"name":"High-res","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1996930/2fd7a897d11ee0a9b38be9f3dc01da2740e64232.jpg"},{"name":"Mercury Poisoning","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/a